      { s: 'Rather than [[viewing]] boredom as [[unproductive]], it should [[regard]] as an opportunity for personal development and constructive contemplation.', w: 2, fix: 'be regarded', ex: '틀린 곳 ▶ ③ regard → be regarded\n이유: 주어 it(= boredom)이 \'여겨지는\' 수동\n나머지 ▶ ① Rather than + 동명사 ✔ ② view A as B의 형용사 보어 ✔' }
